WEBVTT

00:33:26.038 --> 00:33:30.454
ever, and it's up to us to be proactive
about not only reaching out to our

00:33:30.454 --> 00:33:32.204
networks, but expanding them.

00:33:32.954 --> 00:33:36.413
If we're thoughtful about it, we have the
opportunity to stick the landing,

00:33:36.788 --> 00:33:38.579
to come through turbulence, more open,

00:33:38.746 --> 00:33:41.621
more honest and more connected
than before.

00:33:46.121 --> 00:33:47.621
Next time on work life

00:33:49.288 --> 00:33:52.329
and also it's exhausting. Oh, my God.

00:33:52.371 --> 00:33:55.329
Sometimes I just want to
agree to disagree or

00:33:55.496 --> 00:33:59.788
don't agree to disagree. The keys
to solving conflicts at work

00:33:59.788 --> 00:34:02.579
and at home are often hiding
in plain sight